# Art masters (issue #70 portraits, issue #117 map identifiers): never required
# by the application build — the committed optimized derivatives under public/
# are the only assets the app consumes. Keeping the whole master directory out of
# the Docker build context keeps builder payloads small. Rejected/unreferenced
# master copies must never be re-added here.
assets
# Holo Film Studio is a development tool (issue #489): the production image never
# needs its films, art, tests or docs, and nothing in the app imports it.
tools/holo-film-studio
